OL,3,GNEWSA'Baby Tommy's here, Chelsea's
OL,4,Anot': First-time mum dies in childbirth
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family of a first-time mum who died
OL,7,Fin childbirth say her newborn son is
OL,8,Fthe "light" that's keeping them going
OL,9,Fthrough their grief.
OL,11,FChelsea McGillivray suffered an unknown
OL,12,Fcardiac event during labour last Monday
OL,13,Fafter what was believed to be a
OL,14,Ftextbook pregnancy.
OL,16,FThe 31-year-old, from Rutherglen in
OL,17,FSouth Lanarkshire, received CPR but
OL,18,Fdoctors were unable to resuscitate her.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
